{
  "summary": "The experiment tested switching from concat fusion to weighted fusion in a multimodal model using scvi_n200 RNA encoder and imagenet_vit_l image encoder. Validation accuracy decreased slightly to 0.706, suggesting weighted fusion may not improve performance compared to concat. However, uncertainty remains about the exact impact of the fusion strategy without further comparison to alternative methods."
